  // ── 1. Take the filesystem out of service first. ─────────────────────────
  //
  // A STOPPED VM has no live writers, so the config edit is safe on its own and
  // no guest work is possible anyway. A RUNNING VM must be unmounted first. And
  // when Proxmox will not tell us which it is, a volume we know carries a mounted
  // filesystem is NOT unplugged on a guess.
